tion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L315-L325", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "+2.7 accuracy, -12.9 forgetting on CIFAR-100 ResNet-18; next step is to make refresh_anchors_after_calib default."}, {"id": "docs_v1_sunum_router_generalization_gap", "label": "Router generalization gap (94.5% owner acc on prototypes, diffuse on test)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L343-L344", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_v1_sunum_capacity_sweep", "label": "Capacity sweep (max_experts): accuracy flat, forgetting drops", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L298-L313", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_v1_sunum_hybrid_variant", "label": "PAL-MoE hybrid (prototypes + latent replay)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L287-L292", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "~1.2 points gain for ~6.6x memory and loses at equal bytes, so presented as memory flexibility rather than the main result."}, {"id": "docs_v1_sunum_limitations", "label": "PAL-MoE v1 limitations", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L346-L369", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_v1_sunum_icarl_baseline", "label": "iCaRL baseline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L405-L407", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_v1_sunum_frozen_representation_dependence", "label": "Dependence on frozen representation (trainable encoder collapses)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/v1/SUNUM.md", "source_location": "L332-L3